ite\" primary button (reuse Button component! instance of 1:22 with label \"+ Invite\" — actually Button component text \"Button\"; set to \"+ Invite\"), avatar stack 4 + \"+5\" chip.\n\nAvatar stack for phases: each phase row gets 2-3 small avatars (24px) + more icon.\n\nComplete Task chart: panel with title \"Complete Task\", line chart 7 points 67,73,53,47,39,27,27, last point highlighted (dot + maybe label \"27\"). Width ~1300, height 172. X positions spread, y mapped 0-80 range.\n\nLet me write the code. Group frames with clipsContent=false and explicit resize.\n\nAlso invite button: use Button component instance, resize to 110x40? Button default 160x44 radius 10. Set label \"+ Invite\". I'll place instance and set text.\n\nFor member avatars: use small avatars of various people: 6:42 (Cris), 6:55 (Charmie), 6:44 (Jason), 6:40 (Charlie), 6:41 (Claudia), 6:45 (Killan), 6:46 (Milie), 6:47 (Novita), 6:56 (Ikhsan), 6:57 (Ahmed), 6:54 (Aditya).\n\nWrite code now. Screen 10:3.","signature":""}],"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f8fc6e3-e4fa-4bdd-be96-84929415b7a1","uuid":"8397d4b3-3266-4634-9fa3-c9eb1b9366b5","timestamp":"2026-11-02T00:32:35.388Z","thinking_duration_ms":44127}
